   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s013",
   "start": 44.56,
   "end": 48.58,
   "line": "If you want real super strength, look down. In 2010,",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s014",
   "start": 48.58,
   "end": 50.92,
   "line": "scientists tested a tiny dung beetle that",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s015",
   "start": 50.92,
   "end": 53.34,
   "line": "can pull more than a thousand times its own body weight.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s016",
   "start": 53.34,
   "end": 57.46,
   "line": "For you, that would be like pulling eighty tonnes.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s017",
   "start": 57.46,
   "end": 58.78,
   "line": "But here's the catch.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s018",
   "start": 58.78,
   "end": 63.16,
   "line": "Small things are strong for their size. Big things aren't.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s019",
   "start": 63.16,
   "end": 65.34,
   "line": "It's called the square-cube law.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s020",
   "start": 65.34,
   "end": 68.04,
   "line": "Galileo worked it out almost four hundred years ago.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s021",
   "start": 68.04,
   "end": 71.76,
   "line": "Make something twice as big, and its strength goes up four times.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s022",
   "start": 71.76,
   "end": 74.4,
   "line": "But its weight goes up eight times.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s023",
   "start": 74.4,
   "end": 77.08,
   "line": "That's why a beetle the size of a person would collapse.",
